t is because duterte because one of  the big things that duterte did was to  complete the rehabilitation of the  marcosus and when his daughter sarah  duterte the incoming vice president  teamed up with uh freddie and marcus jr  it became an unbeatable team for the  opposition so in that sense he's one of  his biggest legacies will be the return  of the marcuses and let's see how people  were gonna judge the return of the  marcuses but for the foreseeable future  i expect duterte to remain a popular  leader for a lot of filipinos who just  wanted something different after decades  of dysfunctional politics and  half-hearted liberal reforms always good  to talk to you richard many thanks  indeed richard heydarian there in manila

